  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa al Café Coucou.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00760065006E0069006400100003110000FF0101006F006100200061006C002000430061006600E900200043006F00750063006F0075002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos enorgullece poder ofrecer un espacio bonito\ny muy tranquilo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007300200065006E006F007200670075006C006C00650063006500200070006F0064006500720020006F00660072006500630065007200200075006E0020006500730070006100630069006F00200062006F006E00690074006F000A00790020006D007500790020007400720061006E007100750069006C006F002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En el pasado nos hicimos tan populares que no\nnos dábamos abasto con la cantidad de clientes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La atmósfera era tan frenética que a veces no\ntenía tiempo ni de respirar. No podía con el ritmo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, por otro lado, el negocio se iría a pique sin\nclientes. Es todo un dilema...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Entiendes el problema que tenemos?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006E007400690065006E00640065007300200065006C002000700072006F0062006C0065006D00610020007100750065002000740065006E0065006D006F0073003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La verdad es que no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000760065007200640061006400200065007300200071007500650020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No soy Médium...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200073006F00790020004D00E9006400690075006D002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En resumen: quiero que solo venga la cantidad\njusta de clientes para no arruinarnos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY para eso tengo que pensar en un menú idóneo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué podríamos ofrecer?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200070006F0064007200ED0061006D006F00730020006F006600720065006300650072003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Galettes Luminalia",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470061006C006500740074006500730020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Croissants",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430072006F0069007300730061006E007400730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arroz al curry",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720072006F007A00200061006C0020006300750072007200790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, las Galettes Luminalia se venden en todas\npartes. No sería nada novedoso.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las que preparan en el Café Nouveau son\nuna delicia. No podríamos superarlas.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No quiero que nos comparen con el rico curry que\npreparan en el Hotel Z.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm, ¿qué piensas del sushi?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002C002000BF0071007500E90020007000690065006E007300610073002000640065006C002000730075007300680069003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es una comida muy ligera... y no es algo que la\ngente espere encontrar en un café. Creo que<U+0010><U+0001>븀\natraería a la cantidad justa de clientes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está mal echarse flores, ¡pero es muy buena idea!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E10020006D0061006C0020006500630068006100720073006500200066006C006F007200650073002C002000A1007000650072006F0020006500730020006D007500790020006200750065006E006100200069006400650061002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El tema es que nunca he preparado sushi.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C002000740065006D006100200065007300200071007500650020006E0075006E00630061002000680065002000700072006500700061007200610064006F002000730075007300680069002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y no pienso gastarme dinero en el restaurante\nSushi Tres Delicias.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSabes qué te voy a pedir, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No hace falta que me respondas, veo en tu cara\nque no te lo imaginas: quiero que me muestres<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun Tatsugiri. ¡En sus tres formas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cuál de las tres formas de Tatsugiri me quieres\nmostrar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0043007500E1006C0020006400650020006C006100730020007400720065007300200066006F0072006D0061007300200064006500200054006100740073007500670069007200690020006D006500200071007500690065007200650073000A006D006F00730074007200610072003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Curvada",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D0061002000430075007200760061006400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Lánguida",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D00610020004C00E1006E006700750069006400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Recta",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D00610020005200650063007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ninguna por ahora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0069006E00670075006E006100200070006F0072002000610068006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¡no es la forma que me dijiste!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000A1006E006F0020006500730020006C006100200066006F0072006D006100200071007500650020006D0065002000640069006A0069007300740065002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, ¿me vas a enseñar un Tatsugiri, o qué?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002C002000BF006D006500200076006100730020006100200065006E0073006500F10061007200200075006E0020005400610074007300750067006900720069002C0020006F00200071007500E9003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial, un Tatsugiri Forma Curvada!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSería muy complicado doblar el filete de esa\nmanera, pero está perfecto como ejemplo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y no te olvides de mostrarme\nel resto, ¿ok?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E002000590020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C007600690064006500730020006400650020006D006F00730074007200610072006D0065000A0065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF006F006B003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un Tatsugiri Forma Lánguida!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCon esta forma podríamos esconder ingredientes\ndebajo y hacer un sushi sorpresa. ¡Tomo nota!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y no te olvides de mostrarme\nel resto, ¿ok?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E002000590020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C007600690064006500730020006400650020006D006F00730074007200610072006D0065000A0065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF006F006B003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un Tatsugiri Forma Recta!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCreo que quedaría genial si le pusiéramos algo\nencima al sushi. Habrá que pensarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y no te olvides de mostrarme\nel resto, ¿ok?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E002000590020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C007600690064006500730020006400650020006D006F00730074007200610072006D0065000A0065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF006F006B003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco mucho que me hayas mostrado\nlas tres formas de Tatsugiri.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que ya sé cómo preparar sushi. Dame\nun momento, veamos qué tal lo hago.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te parece? Está más que claro que no lo\nhizo un experto, pero no está tan mal.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En mi opinión se venderá lo justo, ya que es obvio\nque no lo preparó un chef de sushi profesional.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, bueno, ¡¿qué es esto?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A100BF0071007500E90020006500730020006500730074006F003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Café con sushi?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00430061006600E900200063006F006E002000730075007300680069003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A quién se le ocurre! ¡Sin duda, la oferta\ngastronómica de esta ciudad es única!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No pienso probarlo, pero siento la necesidad\nde compartirlo con el mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para los que vean este video, ¡miren nada más\nqué menú tan curioso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200610020006C006F007300200071007500650020007600650061006E0020006500730074006500200076006900640065006F002C002000A1006D006900720065006E0020006E0061006400610020006D00E10073000A0071007500E90020006D0065006E00FA002000740061006E00200063007500720069006F0073006F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les presento una novedad con la que van a\nalucinar: ¡café con sushi! Qué cool, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi se les antoja probarlo, ¡vengan al Café Coucou!\nO, mejor dicho, ¡al Café Coucool!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 180
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No puedo resistirme a streamear las maravillas\nque ofrece este mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200070007500650064006F002000720065007300690073007400690072006D006500200061002000730074007200650061006D0065006100720020006C006100730020006D00610072006100760069006C006C00610073000A0071007500650020006F00660072006500630065002000650073007400650020006D0075006E0064006F002E00100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
